OL,3,ALib Dems call for one-to-one midwife
OL,4,Acare during childbirth
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiberal Democrats are calling for
OL,7,Fone-to-one midwife care for women in
OL,8,Flabour, as figures suggest
OL,9,Flife-altering childbirth injuries in
OL,10,FEngland have reached record levels.
OL,12,FLib Dem analysis of NHS figures showed
OL,13,Fthe number of women suffering
OL,14,Fpotentially life-threatening levels of
OL,15,Fblood loss is the highest ever recorded
OL,16,Fin England.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
