OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ALib Dems call for one-to-one midwife
OL,4,Acare during childbirth
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree in every 100 women suffered
OL,7,Fserious tearing injuries requiring
OL,8,Femergency surgery in the first half of
OL,9,Fthis year, something party leader Sir
OL,10,FEd Davey said was a "devastating
OL,11,Findictment of our NHS maternity
OL,12,Fservices".
OL,14,FThe government is expected to publish a
OL,15,Fnew national maternity and neonatal
OL,16,Faction plan by the end of the year.
